  {
   "id": "el97",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1110,
   "width": 972.0000000000001,
   "height": 175.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1191489238,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 426940654,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. User calls InteropCenter.sendMessage / sendBundle with the atomicBundle attribute.\n2. Token leg: L2AssetRouter.initiateIndirectCall burns via the NTV; L2AssetTracker debits.\n3. InteropCenter calls AtomicFlowManager.append(bundleHash, ...).\n4. Commit value inserted into the IMT; the hook emits the leaf as an L2 -> L1 log.\n5. Operator A commits, proves and executes the batch (executeBatchesSharedBridge).\n6. Chain A's batch root is appended: MessageRoot.addChainBatchRootV32.\n7. Operator B reads a MessageRoot root and supplies it to its bootloader.",
   "originalText": "1. User calls InteropCenter.sendMessage / sendBundle with the atomicBundle attribute.\n2. Token leg: L2AssetRouter.initiateIndirectCall burns via the NTV; L2AssetTracker debits.\n3. InteropCenter calls AtomicFlowManager.append(bundleHash, ...).\n4. Commit value inserted into the IMT; the hook emits the leaf as an L2 -> L1 log.\n5. Operator A commits, proves and executes the batch (executeBatchesSharedBridge).\n6. Chain A's batch root is appended: MessageRoot.addChainBatchRootV32.\n7. Operator B reads a MessageRoot root and supplies it to its bootloader.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el98",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240,
   "y": 1110,
   "width": 918.0000000000001,
   "height": 175.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 739017907,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1055740227,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "8. Bootloader imports it: L2InteropRootStorage.addInteropRootsInBatch.\n9. Relayer calls L2InteropHandler.executeAtomicBundle(bundle, finalityProof).\n10. Handler calls AtomicFlowManager.requireFlowFinalized (all legs, before deadline).\n11. Each leg's IMT root: proveL2LeafInclusionShared against imported interopRoots.\n12. Handler calls receiveMessage on each call target (router: finalizeDeposit).\n13. L2NativeTokenVault.bridgeMint; L2AssetTracker credits.\n14. Chain B's batch execution checks imported roots vs MessageRoot.historicalRoot.",
   "originalText": "8. Bootloader imports it: L2InteropRootStorage.addInteropRootsInBatch.\n9. Relayer calls L2InteropHandler.executeAtomicBundle(bundle, finalityProof).\n10. Handler calls AtomicFlowManager.requireFlowFinalized (all legs, before deadline).\n11. Each leg's IMT root: proveL2LeafInclusionShared against imported interopRoots.\n12. Handler calls receiveMessage on each call target (router: finalizeDeposit).\n13. L2NativeTokenVault.bridgeMint; L2AssetTracker credits.\n14. Chain B's batch execution checks imported roots vs MessageRoot.historicalRoot.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el99",
